# SYNTHETIC fixture. Not a captured sweep.
# Hand-built because every sweep this project has captured samples classes
# and nothing else: sampling properties is a later spec stage (2b), so a
# sample carrying sw:sampledBy sw:metric:properties cannot be captured live
# yet. The shape is the same as a class sample except for that one object.
# Exists to make the sw:sampledBy sw:metric:classes pin in
# web/queries/endpoint_content.rq testable: delete that line and every
# other test in this suite stays green, because no other fixture holds a
# sample from a second metric. This endpoint's sampled PROPERTIES would
# then be returned as its classes, by a function documented as answering
# which classes are in there.
